
Your job will be to modify the dev container specification for this git repo.

The specifications for this dev container are in the standard .devcontainer directory in a devcontainer.json
file and accompanying docker files. 

This dev container is used with Visual Studio code for database development using the open source dbt processor. 

The two modifications you'll make are the following:

- install the standalone binary (CLI) of duckdb in the container in a commonly accessible place, like '/usr/local/bin'

- install the VS Code extension "power user for dbt" aka "dbt power user" 

update the documentation for the project.

